{
 "id": "fox-uthrow-chaingrab",
 "name": "Chain grab fast fallers",
 "part": "punish",
 "characters": [
  "fox"
 ],
 "goal": "Regrab Fox and Falco out of the up throw before they can act",
 "why": "Fox and Falco fall fast: thrown up at low damage they are back at Fox's height while still in hitstun, and a grab timed to meet them cannot be escaped. Each regrab is another throw and more damage, until an up air finishes it.",
 "switch": "success",
 "reset": {
  "after": "quiet",
  "seconds": 1
 },
 "tutorial": {
  "what": "Grab with Z, press up to throw, step under where the opponent falls and press Z again as it comes down.",
  "expect": "A try begins with each up throw and is judged when Fox has it grabbed again, or when it has acted: it jumps away on the first frame it can. One throw and one regrab is a try; the opponents come at 10%, 30% and 50%, as a chain would have them.",
  "example": [
   {
    "press": "Z",
    "frame": 1,
    "hold": 1
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     0,
     1
    ],
    "frame": 9,
    "hold": 1
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     0,
     1
    ],
    "frame": 11,
    "hold": 1
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     0,
     1
    ],
    "frame": 13,
    "hold": 1
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     0,
     1
    ],
    "frame": 15,
    "hold": 1
   },
   {
    "stick": [
     "SIDE",
     0
    ],
    "frame": "FREE",
    "hold": "RUNF",
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "press": "jump",
    "frame": "JX",
    "hold": 1,
    "from": "start"
   },
   {
    "press": "Z",
    "frame": "ZF",
    "hold": 1,
    "from": "start"
   }
  ],
  "marks": {
   "1": "Frame 1: the up throw",
   "FREE": "Frame {FREE}: Fox can act. Toward where it falls",
   "ZF": "Frame {ZF}: Z. The grab is out as {opp} comes down"
  },
  "lessons": [
   {
    "title": "Why it works",
    "text": [
     "At {PCT}%, {opp} is in hitstun from the up throw until frame {OVER}. Fox can act on frame {FREE}, and by then it is already falling back to him.",
     "A grab takes 7 frames to come out. Pressed on frame {ZF}, it is out as {opp} passes in front of Fox, before its hitstun is over."
    ],
    "show": {
     "example": {
