   {
    "title": "Following the DI",
    "text": [
     "The opponent's DI through the throw moves where it comes down: in front of Fox, or behind him. Dash that way for a few frames, then X or Y and Z on the next frame: the jump-cancelled grab, out of the dash.",
     "As its damage goes up it flies higher and the grab comes later: frame {ZF} here, at {PCT}%."
    ],
